# GMS poisons the claw: a chance on every hit of 50+4x% a second for a few
# seconds, not stacking. All of it is here now -- the chance is rolled per
# enemy the swing reached, and the poison burns on the monster rather than
# pulsing out of the character.
name: "Venom"
description:
  "Poison is permanently applied to your Claw, giving all your attacks the "
  "chance to Poison enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERMIT skill_order: 7 }
max_level: 10
dot {
  interval_seconds: 1.0
  duration_seconds: 6.0
  lines: 1
  chance: 0.12
  chance_per_level: 0.02
  base { skill_pct: 0.54 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
}
